    {"id": "1-000-000-20-checks", "type": "text", "name": "1,000,000 → ~20 checks", "props": {"x": 960.0, "y": 226.8, "w": 1632.0, "h": 56, "text": "1,000,000 → ~20 checks", "font": "JetBrains Mono", "size": 44, "weight": 600, "color": "#5ef1ff", "align": "center", "lineHeight": 1.1, "reveal": "fade"}, "tall": {"x": 540.0, "y": 451.2, "w": 972.0}},
    {"id": "caption-1", "type": "text", "name": "Caption 1", "props": {"x": 960.0, "y": 988.2, "w": 1536.0, "h": 68, "text": "Binary search finds a number in a sorted list, fast.", "font": "Inter", "size": 48, "weight": 600, "color": "#e6e1f2", "align": "center", "lineHeight": 1.25, "reveal": "fade"}, "folder": "f-captions", "tall": {"x": 540.0, "y": 1536.0, "w": 950.4, "h": 158, "size": 60}},
    {"id": "caption-2", "type": "text", "name": "Caption 2", "props": {"x": 960.0, "y": 988.2, "w": 1536.0, "h": 68, "text": "We're looking for thirty seven.", "font": "Inter", "size": 48, "weight": 600, "color": "#e6e1f2", "align": "center", "lineHeight": 1.25, "reveal": "fade"}, "folder": "f-captions", "tall": {"x": 540.0, "y": 1536.0, "w": 950.4, "h": 158, "size": 60}},
    {"id": "caption-3", "type": "text", "name": "Caption 3", "props": {"x": 960.0, "y": 988.2, "w": 1536.0, "h": 68, "text": "Check the middle. Sixteen is too small.", "font": "Inter", "size": 48, "weight": 600, "color": "#e6e1f2", "align": "center", "lineHeight": 1.25, "reveal": "fade"}, "folder": "f-captions", "tall": {"x": 540.0, "y": 1536.0, "w": 950.4, "h": 158, "size": 60}},
    {"id": "caption-4", "type": "text", "name": "Caption 4", "props": {"x": 960.0, "y": 988.2, "w": 1536.0, "h": 68, "text": "So the whole left half is gone. Thirty seven can't be there.", "font": "Inter", "size": 48, "weight": 600, "color": "#e6e1f2", "align": "center", "lineHeight": 1.25, "reveal": "fade"}, "folder": "f-captions", "tall": {"x": 540.0, "y": 1536.0, "w": 950.4, "h": 233, "size": 60}},
    {"id": "caption-5", "type": "text", "name": "Caption 5", "props": {"x": 960.0, "y": 988.2, "w": 1536.0, "h": 68, "text": "Check the middle of what's left, and cut again.", "font": "Inter", "size": 48, "weight": 600, "color": "#e6e1f2", "align": "center", "lineHeight": 1.25, "reveal": "fade"}, "folder": "f-captions", "tall": {"x": 540.0, "y": 1536.0, "w": 950.4, "h": 158, "size": 60}},
    {"id": "caption-6", "type": "text", "name": "Caption 6", "props": {"x": 960.0, "y": 988.2, "w": 1536.0, "h": 68, "text": "Found it, in two checks. Going one by one takes seven.", "font": "Inter", "size": 48, "weight": 600, "color": "#e6e1f2", "align": "center", "lineHeight": 1.25, "reveal": "fade"}, "folder": "f-captions", "tall": {"x": 540.0, "y": 1536.0, "w": 950.4, "h": 158, "size": 60}},
    {"id": "caption-7", "type": "text", "name": "Caption 7", "props": {"x": 960.0, "y": 988.2, "w": 1536.0, "h": 128, "text": "Each check halves the list, so a million numbers take about twenty checks.", "font": "Inter", "size": 48, "weight": 600, "color": "#e6e1f2", "align": "center", "lineHeight": 1.25, "reveal": "fade"}, "folder": "f-captions", "tall": {"x": 540.0, "y": 1536.0, "w": 950.4, "h": 233, "size": 60}}
